title: Invoke-ShareFinder Network Share Discovery via PowerShell
status: experimental
description: Detects the PowerView function Invoke-ShareFinder in PowerShell script blocks, used to enumerate accessible SMB shares across a domain. Observed on domain controllers in the Akira intrusion.
references:
    - https://thedfirreport.com/2026/06/29/from-bing-search-to-ransomware-bumblebee-and-adaptixc2-deliver-akira-3/
author: Sümeyra Yüksel
date: 2026/10/20
tags:
    - attack.discovery
    - attack.t1135
logsource:
    category: ps_script
    product: windows
detection:
    selection:
        ScriptBlockText|contains: 'Invoke-ShareFinder'
    condition: selection
fields:
    - ScriptBlockText
    - Path
falsepositives:
    - Penetration tests and red team exercises using PowerView
level: high
